  "title": "Smart Ways to Use AI Every Day (and How to Ask Better)",
  "cover_text": "ASK BETTER",
  "description": "Smart, everyday ways to use AI, plus a simple recipe for prompts that get useful answers.\n\nA dad asks, his teen daughter explains: how to summarize long emails, draft and rewrite messages, learn and plan with AI, write clear prompts with task, context and format, and stay smart and safe by checking facts and keeping private info out. Then a quick quiz to test yourself.\n\nWant the 60-second versions? They're on our Shorts tab.\n\nAInation Studio — AI, explained simply for families. Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/@AI.nationstudio",
