  "loop_card": {
    "text": "What will you ask AI?",
    "cue": "next",
    "left": "bulb",
    "right": "robot"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Everyone says AI can save time. But what can it actually do for me, on a normal day?",
      "board": {
        "type": "title",
        "left": {
          "icon": "user",
          "label": "YOU"
        },
        "right": {
          "icon": "robot",
          "label": "AI HELPER"
        },
        "subtitle": "Smart everyday AI",
        "mid": "+"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Loads! And the secret isn't the app. It's how you ask. Good questions get good answers.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "chat",
        "text": "How you ask matters",
        "cue": "ask"
      },
      "punch": "ask"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So what's the plan?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Three everyday uses: summarize, draft, and learn. Then a simple recipe for better prompts, and a few rules to stay safe.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "TODAY",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Summarize",
            "icon": "doc",
            "cue": "summarize"
          },
          {
            "label": "Draft",
            "icon": "mail",
            "cue": "draft"
          },
          {
            "label": "Learn",
            "icon": "book",
            "cue": "learn"
          },
          {
            "label": "Better prompts",
            "icon": "bulb",
            "cue": "prompts"
          },
          {
            "label": "Stay safe",
            "icon": "shield",
            "cue": "safe"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Number one. What do you mean by summarize?",
      "chapter": "Summarize",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "doc",
        "text": "1. Summarize",
        "cue": "summarize"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Paste in a long email, article, or document, and ask for the key points. It turns a wall of text into a short list.",
      "board": {
        "type": "chat",
        "title": "SUMMARIZE",
        "items": [
          {
            "who": "user",
            "text": "Give me the key points",
            "cue": "paste"
          },
          {
            "who": "bot",
            "text": "1... 2... 3...",
            "cue": "list"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#0A84FF"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Like the school newsletter that goes on for pages?",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "📰",
        "text": "Long newsletter?",
        "cue": "newsletter"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Exactly. Ask: what are the dates, and what do I need to do? You get just the important parts.",
      "board": {
        "type": "chat",
        "title": "ASK FOR WHAT MATTERS",
        "items": [
          {
            "who": "user",
            "text": "Dates and to-dos?",
            "cue": "dates"
          },
          {
            "who": "bot",
            "text": "Here's what to do...",
            "cue": "important"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#2ECC71"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "But skim the original for anything important. Summaries can miss things, or get details wrong.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "warn",
        "text": "Skim the original",
        "cue": "skim",
        "sub": "Summaries can miss things",
        "sub_cue": "miss"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Number two. Can it help me write?",
      "chapter": "Draft and rewrite",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "mail",
        "text": "2. Draft & rewrite",
        "cue": "write"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Yes. Ask for a first draft. A polite reply, a thank-you note, a complaint that stays calm. Then make it sound like you.",
      "board": {
        "type": "chat",
        "title": "DRAFT",
        "items": [
          {
            "who": "user",
            "text": "A polite reply, please",
            "cue": "polite"
          },
          {
            "who": "bot",
            "text": "Here's a draft...",
            "cue": "sound"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#2ECC71"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Why not just send what it writes?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Because it doesn't know you or the full situation. It can sound stiff, or say things you didn't mean. You're the editor.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "AI DRAFT",
          "color": "#0A84FF",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Can sound stiff",
              "icon": "warn",
              "cue": "stiff"
            }
          ]
        },
        "right": {
          "label": "YOU",
          "color": "#E91E63",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The editor",
              "icon": "check",
              "cue": "editor",
              "tick": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "punch": "editor"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Can it fix my own writing too?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Totally. Paste your text and ask: make this shorter, friendlier, or clearer. You pick the tone, it does the rewriting.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "REWRITE IT",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Shorter",
            "icon": "✂️",
            "cue": "shorter"
          },
          {
            "label": "Friendlier",
            "icon": "🙂",
            "cue": "friendlier"
          },
          {
            "label": "Clearer",
            "icon": "bulb",
            "cue": "clearer"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#8E44AD"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Number three. You said learn?",
      "chapter": "Learn and plan",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "book",
        "text": "3. Learn & plan",
        "cue": "learn"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Ask it to explain something like you're new to it. Then keep asking follow-up questions until it clicks.",
      "board": {
        "type": "chat",
        "title": "LEARN",
        "items": [
          {
            "who": "user",
            "text": "Explain like I'm new",
            "cue": "explain"
          },
          {
            "who": "bot",
            "text": "Think of it like...",
            "cue": "follow-up"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#8E44AD"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Like a patient tutor.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "user",
        "text": "A patient tutor",
        "cue": "patient"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Right. You can even ask it to quiz you. Great before a test, or when learning a new skill for work.",
      "board": {
        "type": "chat",
        "title": "QUIZ ME",
        "items": [
          {
            "who": "user",
            "text": "Quiz me on this",
            "cue": "quiz"
          },
          {
            "who": "bot",
            "text": "Question 1...",
            "cue": "test"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Can it help plan things too? Like dinners for the week?",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "calendar",
        "text": "Plan the week?",
        "cue": "plan"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Sure. Tell it what you have, what you like, and any limits. It can suggest meals, a shopping list, or a schedule.",
      "board": {
        "type": "journey",
        "title": "PLAN IT",
        "traveler": "📝",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🥕",
            "label": "What you have",
            "cue": "have"
          },
          {
            "icon": "❤️",
            "label": "What you like",
            "cue": "like"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🚫",
            "label": "Your limits",
            "cue": "limits"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🛒",
            "label": "Meals & list",
            "cue": "meals"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#2ECC71"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "For health, money, or legal questions, use it to prepare your questions, then check with a real expert.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "shield",
        "text": "Check with an expert",
        "cue": "expert"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "You said the secret is how you ask. Sometimes I get really useless answers.",
      "chapter": "Better prompts",
      "board": {
        "type": "title",
        "left": {
          "icon": "x",
          "label": "VAGUE"
        },
        "right": {
          "icon": "bulb",
          "label": "CLEAR"
        },
        "subtitle": "Better prompts",
        "mid": "→"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Usually that's because the prompt is too vague. A prompt is just the instructions you give the AI.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "chat",
        "text": "Prompt = instructions",
        "cue": "instructions"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So what's a vague one?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Like, write a poem. About what? How long? For who? The AI has to guess.",
      "board": {
        "type": "chat",
        "title": "VAGUE PROMPT",
        "items": [
          {
            "who": "user",
            "text": "Write a poem.",
            "cue": "write"
          },
          {
            "who": "bot",
            "text": "About what? How long?",
            "cue": "guess"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#FF4D6D"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Okay, how do I fix it?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Use three parts. The task, what to do. The context, who it's for and why. And the format, like length or style.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "GOOD PROMPT",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Task: what to do",
            "icon": "target",
            "cue": "task"
          },
          {
            "label": "Context: who & why",
            "icon": "book",
            "cue": "context"
          },
          {
            "label": "Format: length, style",
            "icon": "doc",
            "cue": "format"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#2ECC71"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Example, please!"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Write a short, funny poem for my dad's birthday. He loves fishing and bad jokes. Keep it under eight lines.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "VAGUE",
          "color": "#FF4D6D",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Write a poem",
              "icon": "doc",
              "cue": "write"
            }
          ]
        },
        "right": {
          "label": "CLEAR",
          "color": "#2ECC71",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Funny birthday poem",
              "icon": "target",
              "cue": "funny",
              "tick": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Loves fishing",
              "icon": "book",
              "cue": "fishing",
              "tick": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Under 8 lines",
              "icon": "doc",
              "cue": "under",
              "tick": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Hey, I do love fishing!",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🎣",
        "text": "Loves fishing!",
        "cue": "fishing"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Bonus tip: give it a role. Like, you are a friendly coach, or a patient teacher. It changes the style of the answer.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "user",
        "text": "Give it a role",
        "cue": "role",
        "sub": "\"You are a patient teacher...\"",
        "sub_cue": "teacher"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "And if the answer still isn't right?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Treat it as a conversation. Ask, read the answer, then reply with what to change. Shorter, friendlier, add an example. Repeat until it's right.",
      "board": {
        "type": "cycle",
        "title": "REFINE IT",
        "center": "💬",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "💬",
            "label": "Ask",
            "cue": "ask"
          },
          {
            "icon": "👀",
            "label": "Read it",
            "cue": "read"
          },
          {
            "icon": "✏️",
            "label": "Ask for changes",
            "cue": "reply"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🔁",
            "label": "Repeat",
            "cue": "repeat"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#2ECC71"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Another trick: ask it to ask you questions first. Like, before you answer, ask me what you need to know.",
      "board": {
        "type": "chat",
        "title": "LET IT ASK YOU",
        "items": [
          {
            "who": "user",
            "text": "Ask me questions first",
            "cue": "before"
          },
          {
            "who": "bot",
            "text": "Who is it for?",
            "cue": "know"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#0A84FF"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "This is great. Is there a catch?",
      "chapter": "Stay smart and safe",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "warn",
        "text": "Any catch?",
        "cue": "catch"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Two big ones. First, AI can sound confident and still be wrong. It sometimes makes things up.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "warn",
        "text": "Confident ≠ correct",
        "cue": "confident",
        "sub": "It can make things up",
        "sub_cue": "makes"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "So check important facts with a trusted source, especially dates, numbers, health, and money.",
      "board": {
        "type": "checklist",
        "title": "Double-check",
        "icon": "search",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Dates & numbers",
            "cue": "dates",
            "ok": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Health",
            "cue": "health",
            "ok": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Money",
            "cue": "money",
            "ok": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "And the second?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Privacy. Don't paste passwords, bank details, ID numbers, or private family info. Assume what you type may be stored.",
      "board": {
        "type": "checklist",
        "title": "Keep it out",
        "icon": "lock",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Passwords",
            "cue": "passwords",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Bank details",
            "cue": "bank",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "ID numbers",
            "cue": "id",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Private family info",
            "cue": "private",
            "ok": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "What about kids using it for homework?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Use it like a tutor, not a cheat sheet. Ask it to explain, then do the work yourself, and follow your school's rules.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "YES",
          "color": "#2ECC71",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Like a tutor",
              "icon": "check",
              "cue": "tutor",
              "tick": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "right": {
          "label": "NO",
          "color": "#FF4D6D",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A cheat sheet",
              "icon": "x",
              "cue": "cheat"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "And which app should we use?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Any good chatbot works. Try a free one, ask the same question in two apps, and keep the one you like best.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "PICK AN APP",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Try a free one",
            "icon": "coin",
            "cue": "free"
          },
          {
            "label": "Ask the same question",
            "icon": "chat",
            "cue": "same"
          },
          {
            "label": "Keep your favorite",
            "icon": "check",
            "cue": "keep"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#0A84FF"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Quiz time, Dad! What are the three parts of a good prompt? Think...",
      "chapter": "Quiz",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "❓",
        "text": "Quiz time!",
        "cue": "quiz",
        "sub": "3 parts of a prompt?",
        "sub_cue": "parts"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Task, context, and format!",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "GOOD PROMPT",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Task",
            "icon": "target",
            "cue": "task"
          },
          {
            "label": "Context",
            "icon": "book",
            "cue": "context"
          },
          {
            "label": "Format",
            "icon": "doc",
            "cue": "format"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#2ECC71"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Yes! Next. AI gives you a confident answer about a medicine. What do you do? Think...",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "warn",
        "text": "Confident answer?",
        "cue": "confident"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Check it with a trusted source, like a doctor or pharmacist.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "check",
        "text": "Check a trusted source",
        "cue": "trusted"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Last one. Should you paste your bank password to get help? Think...",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "lock",
        "text": "Bank password?",
        "cue": "bank"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Never! Passwords stay private.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "x",
        "text": "Never!",
        "cue": "never"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So: summarize, draft, and learn, with clear prompts, and check what matters.",
      "board": {
        "type": "summary",
        "rows": [
          {
            "text": "SUMMARIZE, DRAFT, LEARN",
            "icon": "bulb",
            "cue": "summarize",
            "color": "#0A84FF"
          },
          {
            "text": "TASK, CONTEXT, FORMAT",
            "icon": "target",
            "cue": "clear",
            "color": "#E91E63"
          },
          {
            "text": "CHECK & STAY PRIVATE",
            "icon": "shield",
            "cue": "check",
            "color": "#2ECC71"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Perfect score! Start small. Try one of these today, and see how much time it saves.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "bulb",
        "text": "Try one today",
        "cue": "try"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "You got it! Subscribe to AI Nation Studio, and share this with a friend! And next time you're stuck... what will you ask AI to help with?"
    }
  ]
}